      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ここはオレらの一品勝負の商船よォ！\r\n見ろよ、この素晴らしさ！魂込めっ込めだぜ！",
        "official_en": "We’ll be sailin’ n’ sellin’ but one shiny trinket, yet it be the finest treasure ye ever lay eyes on!",
        "real_en": "We're a merchant ship that stakes everything on one special item! Just look at this beauty! We put our hearts and souls into it!"
      },
