      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "なーにィ？　金が足りてないってか！？\r\nいくらアンタでもそれじゃあ売れねェなァ。",
        "official_en": "Avast! Ye don’t have enough gil! I like ye, but I can’t let ye haggle with me.",
        "real_en": "What? You don't have enough money!? Even for you, I can't sell it without enough gil!"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
